# Probe build behind the cursor-placement measurements. Reproduce it with
#   git archive cc1bef5 src | tar -x -C <dir> && patch -p2 -d <dir> < probe_cursor_placement.diff
# It adds scorch_ops.probe_set(steal, trace, cmode) / probe_dump() and, in spmm_csr_v2_core,
# a run-time switch for stealing (steal), a per-call per-worker trace (trace), and the cursor
# placement (cmode 0 caller stack, 1 persistent written by the caller, 2 persistent written by
# each owner). Drivers: probe_steal.py, probe_setup.py; readers: probe_ab_read.py, trace_read.py.

